s.","Net reinvestment is nil (capex and working capital no more than cover depreciation), so fundamental growth is near zero.","Margins are contracting (-1.6% trend).","It has beaten earnings estimates by 6.2% on average.","Analysts expect 12.1% long-term annual earnings growth."],"own":["Insiders own 37.6%, meaningful skin in the game, and institutions hold 78%.","Insider trading is two-way: 1 purchase and 80 sales over the past year, net $20.0M sold.","It returns 13.1% a year to shareholders (13.1% in buybacks).","The share count has shrunk 6.4% a year over five years, steadily raising each holder's stake.","Short interest is elevated at 31.7% of the float, 8.5 days to cover."],"people":["With about 2,314 employees, each generates about $1.0M of revenue, 2.0x the Financial Services median, and productivity has risen 11.2% a year.","That works out to $455K of free cash flow per employee.","CEO pay is $934K (1x revenue per employee), and compensation governance scores poorly (10/10, lower is better).","Stock compensation averages $22K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"WATCH","conv":69,"head":"Watch: p/E 17.2x vs sector 12.2x.","pros":["Trades 27% below fair value of $730","ROE 27.8% vs cost of equity 10.8%","P/FCF 5.1x vs sector 12.9x","12-1 month momentum +29%","Returns 13.1% a year to shareholders"],"cons":["P/E 17.2x vs sector 12.2x","Operating margin contracting 1.6%/yr"],"flags":[],"need":["the model rates it HOLD"],"buy_below":620.39,"vc":{"base":729.87,"base_src":"dcf","bear":598.79,"bull":904.47,"alt_median":369.33,"n_alt":2,"gap":0.9762,"dispersion":0.3268,"level":"LOW","why":["models disagree (33% dispersion)","DCF is 98% above the other models' median ($369)"]},"med":{"pe":12.155,"ev_ebitda":10.862,"pfcf":12.9041,"pb":1.3934,"roic":0.116,"gross_margin":0.4181,"fcf_margin":0.2507,"div_yield":0.0265}},"ticker":"CACC","date":"2026-11-06"}